# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — JDK 17.0.13+ 补丁版本与旧 Maven 构建插件不兼容（bundle 插件 CME + javadoc doclint）═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-27
# Software: jakarta-inject-api 2.0.1（所有 Maven 工程在新 JDK 补丁版上构建通用）
# Gate: conan create build() mvn 执行
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E606
title: JDK 17.0.13+ 补丁版本与旧 Maven 构建插件不兼容：maven-bundle-plugin 4.2.1 ConcurrentModificationException（bnd/ZipFile）+ javadoc doclint heading-sequence 报错，插件就地升 5.1.9 + doclint:none 一类修复
trigger_tool: mvn
phase: build
error_signature: "ConcurrentModificationException.*ZipFile|java.util.zip.ZipFile|error: heading used out of sequence: <H[0-9]>"
severity:               2
category:               portability, java, jdk, maven
match_keywords: ConcurrentModificationException, ZipFile, bnd, maven-bundle-plugin,
  doclint, heading used out of sequence, JDK 17.0.13, bishengjdk
root_cause: 上游发行 tarball 的 pom 停留在旧 JDK 时代的插件版本；JDK 17.0.13+ 等新
  补丁版本改变了 ZipFile 内部实现与 javadoc doclint 严格度，旧插件（bnd 4.x、javadoc
  3.3.0 默认 doclint）在构建期崩溃/报错。属一类问题：任何 Maven 工程在新 JDK 补丁版
  上构建都可能触发，按 error_signature 定位插件与配置即可复用本修复。
rec_approach: bundle-plugin-5.1.9-pin + doclint-none + conandata-portability-patch
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
last_updated:               2026-10-16
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E606.md
affected_scope:         JDK 17.0.13+ 补丁版本与旧 Maven 构建插件不兼容：maven-bundle-plugin 4.2.1 
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR n/a）
rec_description:        bundle-plugin-5
